    "body": "Oh interesting, I didn't know that [we could go down](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/C#populating-a-session-history-entry:hand-off-to-external-software-2) the external software path here, in the **non** non-fetch scheme path. Or I probably knew, and promptly forgot. Could we maybe elaborate on this being different from that path by saying something like:\r\n\r\n> Handing off to external software in this path is distinct from the non-fetch scheme branch, in that we know the entry's URL is a fetch scheme, however the resource cannot be handled in a traditional way.\r\n\r\nMeh, maybe that's obvious and just weird to enunciate here. I like it a little less after writing it out. I'll leave it to you.",
