    "body": "I agree this could use improvement. I think I ran into a similar confusion myself when moving this around, and then convinced myself that this was about (2).\r\n\r\nI think it's borderline how useful noting (2) is. On the one hand, yes of course fetching will follow redirects. On the other hand, maybe it's not obvious that we enter step 5, and people might be assuming that the entry URL you enter the algorithm with will be the one used while creating a non-fetch scheme document?\r\n\r\nAfter writing this out, I lean toward deleting it, so I'll do that for now.",
